757", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823271_1828362921125423_3666720472601451674_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fITVxhWE5HgQ7kNvwHFULbU&_nc_oc=Adq2Q_lqPAnLas_tkqeJDF-flD3i4Af82RPExP_LvHjftK44Pq5iKZdBLlQtgRtd3qo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQt-Q6LGmT0sz1x65Dxj2IVIGZV1LCqFYv9X1QOfWAeBw&oe=6AFB38C7"}, "display_name": "Archery VR", "keywords": ["Archery", "Shooter", "Simulation", "Birds", "Arcade"], "long_description": "**Overview**\n\nArchery VR is a focused arcade shooter designed to demonstrate high-fidelity VR mechanics. Step into an immersive environment and test your marksmanship against dynamic, fast-moving avian targets.\n\n**Key Features**\n* **Physics-Based Archery:** satisfying and realistic bow handling tailored for the Meta Quest 3 controllers.\n* **Bird Hunting:** Track and shoot down birds with precision timing. The harder the shot, the more satisfying the hit.\n* **High Score Challenge:** A pure gameplay loop focused on skill improvement and beating your personal best.\n* **Immersive Environment:** Clean visuals and responsive audio feedback create a satisfying shooting experience.\n\n**About This Project**\nThis game serves as a portfolio piece demonstrating proficiency in Unity VR development and C# scripting. It highlights the use of the Meta XR Interaction SDK to create smooth, responsive player interactions.", "short_description": "A fast-paced VR archery simulation. Master realistic bow mechanics to shoot down flying birds and compete for the highest score. Features satisfying physics, precision aiming. Created as a technical portfolio showcase for immersive VR interactions on Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/archeryvr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AlanSalam", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/vi